* @title Gimpel FORTREAD FORTRAN statement reader
* @attribution James F. Gimpel, Algorithms in SNOBOL4, Chapter 9.2 (FORTREAD), which is built on Chapter 9.1 (READ)
* @input >>>
* C This is a comment card
*       X = 1
*       Y = X +
*      *2 +
*      *3
* C Another comment between statements
*       Z = Y
* <<<
* @expect >>>
* [      X = 1]
* [      Y = X +2 +3]
* [      Z = Y]
* <<<
-INCLUDE "FORTREAD.INC"
LOOP	S = FORTREAD()                  :F(DONE)
	OUTPUT = '[' S ']'              :(LOOP)
DONE
END
